# quest/039/BanDwa108_03909 — « How Do You Do, Fellow Dwarves» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト受注クラス・ジョブ制限</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※本クエストは受注時のクラスでのみ進行します。<br><br>ワッツハンマー・ガレージのレギットは、不審者の目撃情報を心配しているようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung (Job/Klasse darf nicht gewechselt werden)</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Regitt macht sich Sorgen wegen Augenzeugenberichten über verdächtige Personen.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête avec limitation de job ou de classe</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><i>* Il n'est possible de progresser dans cette quête qu'avec la classe qui a servi à la commencer.</i><br><br>Regitt s'inquiète de la présence d'un rôdeur près du Garage Watts.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Regitt is jumping at shadows both real and imagined.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level. Furthermore, you may not proceed with a class or job that is different from when you accepted this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 風化した大地のガレージ周辺で不審な人影を探し<br>チャットの「Say」モードで『ラリホー』と入力し呼びかける
#. de: In den Verwitterten Landen nach verdächtigen Personen suchen und mittels des „Sagen“-Chatmodus mit „Holladrio“ ansprechen
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, saisir une phrase contenant “lali-ho” devant un individu suspect, à Éolisate
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Search for a suspicious figure near Weathering, and with the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, enter “lali-ho” to announce your presence."
msgstr ""

#. ja: レギットに報告
#. de: Regitt berichten
#. fr: Parler à Regitt
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Report to Regitt."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>、聞いてラリ……。<br>最近ガレージの近くで、不審者が目撃されてるラリよ……！<br>ワシらの金品を狙う、悪いヤツかもラリ！
#. de: Hör mal, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, ich muss was mit dir besprechen. In letzter Zeit häufen sich die Berichte über verdächtige Personen im Umkreis der Werkstatt! Ich verwette meinen Bart, dass es sich hier um üble Halunken handelt, die es auf unsere Wertsachen abgesehen haben!
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, tu as entendu la dernière<nbsp>? On a aperçu un individu louche tourner autour du Garage Watts... C'est un sacripant qui en veut à nos matériaux précieux ou aux plans de l'automatank, c'est sûr<nbsp>!
#. speaker: REGITT
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_001:1"
msgid "I trust all is well with you, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Would that I could say the same for myself. My scouts have recently spotted a suspicious figure skulking about, doubtless looking for an opportunity to abscond with our precious metals."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 忍び込まれたら自慢のハンマーで、こうボカッと、ドゴッと！！<br>……なんて、やっつけるイメージだけはできるけど、<br>荒事はできるだけ避けたいラリ……！
#. de: Also, wenn die sich hier tatsächlich in die Werkstatt reinschleichen, dann gibt es ein Hammerprojekt der schmerzhaften Art, aber voll auf die Zwölf! Ich befürchte nur, dass dabei zu viel Arbeitszeit verloren gehen könnte und möchte das daher gerne vermeiden ...
#. fr: Crois-moi, je serais le premier à lui mettre un <i>bon</i> coup de mon marteau si on l'attrapait à fouiner dans l'atelier, mais il vaut peut-être mieux tirer les choses au clair pour régler ça de manière pacifique.
#. speaker: REGITT
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_002:1"
msgid "Make no mistake, if that scoundrel dares to step foot in my workshop, I won't hesitate to take my hammer and give whoever─or whatever─it is a walloping they won't soon forget, but I must admit I don't savor the thought of doing so. My talents lie in crafting, not combat. "
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこで、武人でもあるお前さんに、<br>目撃情報があったガレージ周辺の巡回をお願いしたいラリ！<br>不審者がいたら「ラリホー」と挨拶し、様子をうかがうラリよ！
#. de: Deswegen würde ich es lieber sehen, wenn die ganze Sache ohne Krawall aus der Welt geschafft werden könnte. Du kannst dich ja mal in der Gegend umschauen, wo diese Halunken gesichtet wurden. Wenn du jemand Verdächtiges triffst, dann grüße erst mal mit einem ordentlichen „Holladrio“ und frage, was die hier wollen. Hoffentlich löst sich das ja als simples Miss<shy>ver<shy>ständ<shy>nis auf. Wenn nicht, dann<nbsp>... nun ja<nbsp>... wie gesagt, voll auf die Zwölf!
#. fr: Toi qui en imposes, tu voudrais pas aller patrouiller dans les environs<nbsp>? Si tu tombes sur l'individu en question, adresse-lui un “lali-ho” bien senti pour lui faire comprendre où il met les pieds<nbsp>!
#. speaker: REGITT
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_003:1"
msgid "You, however, are artisan and warrior both! I would ask you to patrol the area where the suspect was last sighted, and if you spot anyone, greet them with a hearty lali-ho. I pray you're able to resolve this matter with words, but if they should prove hostile, well...I'll pray for your safe return!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: …………なんだ、貴様は？<br>俺は、ヨソ者が羽目を外さないよう、見張っているだけだ。
#. de: Hast du 'n Problem? Geh bloß weiter!
#. fr: ... Qu'est-ce que tu m'veux<nbsp>? J'te conseille de garder tes distances ou ça va chauffer pour toi, <if $gn4>poulette<else>blanc-bec</if>.
#. speaker: ELF03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_ELF03909_000_010:1"
msgid "And just who the hells are you, eh? Quite the unsavory type, and believe me, I would know. Stay well away if you know what's good for you."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで『ラリホー』を含む、<br>好きな言葉を入力し、紫葉団のエルフ族に呼びかけましょう。
#. de: Gib im „Sagen“-Chatmodus über Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur einen beliebigen Satz ein, der „Holladrio“ enthält, um den Nachtschattenelf anzusprechen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour dire “lali-ho” à l'Elfe des Fanes pourpres.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SYSTEM_000_110:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter any phrase containing the word “lali-ho” to greet the Nightshade elf."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チッ……お前も、あの忌々しいドワーフの仲間か！<br>レイクランドは我らエルフの土地、覚えておけ！！
#. de: Tss! Bist wohl <if $gn4>Komplizin<else>Komplize</if> dieses dreckigen Zwergengesindels, was? Das Seenland gehört uns, merkt euch das!
#. fr: T'es avec ces affreux Nains, hein<nbsp>? Tu peux leur dire que Grand-Lac est le territoire des Elfes et qu'ils ont intérêt à se tenir à carreau<nbsp>!
#. speaker: ELF03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_ELF03909_000_011:1"
msgid "You...you're in league with those sodding dwarves! Well, you go back to your masters and tell them one thing: Lakeland belongs to the elves─every ilm of it!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おや、<split " " 2><string $gs1></split>様ではありませんか！<br>このようなところで、いかがされました？
#. de: Nanu? Oh, welch freudige Überraschung, <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ihr an diesem Ort? Was verschafft mir die Ehre?
#. fr: Ça alors, je ne m'attendais pas à rencontrer <if $gn4>la Guerrière<else>le Guerrier</if> des Ténèbres dans un endroit pareil<nbsp>! Comment allez-vous<nbsp>?
#. speaker: GUARD03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_GUARD03909_000_012:1"
msgid "Well, well, I didn't expect to see the bleedin' hero of the realm on today of all days! To what do I owe the honor?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで『ラリホー』を含む、<br>好きな言葉を入力し、哨戒中の衛兵に呼びかけましょう。
#. de: Gib im „Sagen“-Chatmodus über Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur einen beliebigen Satz ein, der „Holladrio“ enthält, um den Wachsoldaten auf Patrouille anzusprechen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour dire “lali-ho” au soldat en patrouille.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SYSTEM_000_112:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter any phrase containing the word “lali-ho” to greet the vigilant guard."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ははっ、ガレージのドワーフたちの挨拶ですね！<br>オスタル厳命城を訪ねてきた彼らに、私も教えてもらいましたよ。
#. de: Holladrio? Ach, das ist die Begrüßung der Zwerge, richtig? Die Zwerge in Ostalls Befehl grüßen ebenfalls stets auf diese Weise.
#. fr: Ha ha<nbsp>! C'est le salut des Nains du Garage Watts, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? L'un d'eux me l'a appris, alors qu'il était de passage à L'Impératif d'Ostall.
#. speaker: GUARD03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_GUARD03909_000_013:1"
msgid "Oh, I know that one! That's what them dwarves over at the Anvil say, innit? A few of them came down this way and hailed me with those selfsame words."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ラリホー！<br>それでは、お気をつけて！
#. de: Nun denn, auch ich wünsche ein bärtiges Holladrio, ha ha. Und weiterhin viel Erfolg bei all Euren Unternehmungen!
#. fr: Lali-ho, <if $gn4>Dame<else>Messire</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Prenez bien soin de vous<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GUARD03909
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_GUARD03909_000_113:1"
msgid "Lali-ho! Heh heh...<br>Well, wherever you're headed, stay out of trouble, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ラ……ラ、リ？<br>リホ……ラ……？？？
#. de: Holla! Holla! Holladrio!
#. fr: La... lali<nbsp>? Li-ho... La...<nbsp>???
#. speaker: GREMLIN03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_GREMLIN03909_000_014:1"
msgid "Lali-ho! Ho ho!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで『ラリホー』を含む、<br>好きな言葉を入力し、はぐれグレムリンに呼びかけましょう。
#. de: Gib im „Sagen“-Chatmodus über Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur einen beliebigen Satz ein, der „Holladrio“ enthält, um den verirrten Gremlin anzusprechen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour dire “lali-ho” au gremlin égaré.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SYSTEM_000_114:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter any phrase containing the word “lali-ho” to greet the wayward gremlin."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ラァリホーォォォォ！！！！
#. de: Holla! Hollabolla! Holladrio!
#. fr: LALI-HOOO<nbsp>!!!
#. speaker: GREMLIN03909
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_GREMLIN03909_000_015:1"
msgid "Lali-ho! Lali-ho, lali-ho! Ho ho ho!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: はぐれグレムリンは、挨拶の言葉を叫びながら、<br>上機嫌そうに去っていった……。
#. de: Der verirrte Gremlin wiederholt die Begrüßungsworte mehrmals, bevor er sich gut gelaunt seines Weges trollt.
#. fr: Le gremlin s'en est allé en hurlant “lali-ho”, visiblement satisfait...
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SYSTEM_000_016:1"
msgid "The gremlin mimics the greeting repeatedly, looking quite pleased with itself as it scampers away."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 不審者、見つかったラリか！？<br>どどどど、どうだったラリ……！？
#. de: Hast du die verdächtige Person gesehen? Wer oder was war es?
#. fr: T-t'as trouvé l'intrus<nbsp>? Il t'a pas fait du mal, j'espère<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: REGITT
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_020:1"
msgid "Who─ Who's that!?<br>Oh, it's you, at last! Well, what did you find out about this intruder?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふぃ～っ、それならひと安心ラリ！<br>すぐにガレージを襲ってくるようなヤツだったら、<br>どうしようって思ってたラリ～……！
#. de: Puh, das erleichtert mich zu hören! Gut, dass unsere Wertsachen nicht in Gefahr sind und der Hammer nicht zum Einsatz kommen muss.
#. fr: ... Vraiment<nbsp>!? Aaah, si c'est que ça, y a pas de quoi s'inquiéter<nbsp>! Tant mieux, ça m'évitera d'abîmer mon marteau préféré pour taper sur la caboche d'un voleur.
#. speaker: REGITT
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_021:1"
msgid "Phew, you couldn't have come with better news. Truth be told, I practically soiled myself just imagining what I might have to do with this hammer if something surly were to come this way. Out of pity for them, of course, not fear for myself!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それにしても、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>が、<br>協力してくれていて、本当に心強いラリ！<br>また不審者が目撃されたら、相談に乗ってほしいラリよ～！
#. de: Ich muss wirklich sagen, es ist ein Glück, dass wir dich hier bei uns haben! Falls wieder mal jemand Verdächtiges hier rumschleicht, komme ich wieder auf dich zurück, wenn's recht ist.
#. fr: Un grand merci à toi, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! On se sent en sécurité quand t'es dans le coin. Si jamais y a d'autres rôdeurs, je compte sur toi pour tirer ça au clair<nbsp>!
#. speaker: REGITT
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_REGITT_000_022:1"
msgid "Regardless, I'm glad we had you to check up on things for us. Always prepare for the worst, eh? Speaking of which, if any other suspicious fellows wander near the Anvil, I trust I can count on you once more."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ラリホー
#. de: Holladrio
#. fr: lali-ho
#. speaker: SAYTODO
msgctxt "quest/039/BanDwa108_03909:TEXT_BANDWA108_03909_SAYTODO_000_030:1"
msgid "lali-ho"
msgstr ""
